    "detailed_description": "Rock, Paper, Scissors Simulator is everyone's childhood nostalgic game now in first person perspective. <br />\r\nThe game features nice graphics, full body animations and immersive dialogues.<br />\r\nWhile playing, you and your opponent maintain dialogues inspired by various TV-series.<br />\r\nThis game is not just a Rock, Paper, Scissors simulator, but about simulating being an urchin, hanging out with your friend on a treehouse, treating your nostalgia. <br />\r\nBuy this game to have this unique and so familiar game in your library.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFirst ever 3d first person view RPS simulation.<br />\r\nDialogues with face animations<br />\r\nImmerse yourself into good old times<br />\r\nGreat atmosphere<br />\r\nExperience being on a treehouse in a Canadian suburb",
